'''Battle Balloon''' (バトルバルーン, '''Batorubarūn''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Battle Balloon
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 217.png
|money drop = 800円 ~ 3,160円
}}

==Enemy==
Battle Balloon has decently high health, rather low damage and above average range at 333, this makes Battle Balloon able to outrange many [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Mer-Cat]] and more. However other Anti-Floating Cats like [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]], [[Sodom (Uber Rare Cat)|Sodom]] and more can easily deal with this enemy. Using Anti-Floating tankers like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sadako]] and [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]] can keep it stalled for a long time.

